\n<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"custom-pr-section\" style=\"padding: 10px;\">\n        <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0502\/8695\/2631\/files\/2_1.jpg?v=1641906570\" style=\"margin: 0 auto;\">\n        <h3>2. Build the Frame.<\/h3>\n        <p>Build a frame using our manual, online videos and community making the process simple. Allow 1 to 2 days for a frame build depending on which kit!<br><br>\n       <\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"custom-pr-section third-section\" style=\"padding: 10px;\">\n        <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0502\/8695\/2631\/files\/3_1.jpg?v=1641906753\" style=\"margin: 0 auto;\">\n        <h3>3. Add Components.<\/h3>\n        <p>Choose a fork or  <a href=\"https:\/\/bamboobicycleclub.org\/collections\/component-packs\">Component Pack<\/a> for your frame we offer a range of road and gravel packs making it easy to finish your frame.<br><br>\n<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"custom-pr-section\" style=\"padding: 10px;\">\n        <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0502\/8695\/2631\/files\/4_3.jpg?v=1641908966\" style=\"margin: 0 auto;\">\n        <h3>4. Ride and Share.<\/h3>\n        <p>Once your project is completed, ride and enjoys years of usage out of your finished bike.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <\/div>","width":"wrapper--full","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_custom_html_Xqh9kP":{"type":"section-custom-html","disabled":true,"settings":{"custom_code":"<h2 class=\"mobile_text\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:40px;\">HOW TO BUILD YOUR BAMBOO BIKE<\/h2>\n\n<style>\n.custom-pr {\n    padding: 0 15px;\n}\n.custom-pr-section > img {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 320px) and (max-width: 592px) {\n    .mobile_text {\n        font-size: 17px;\n    }\n    .custom-pr {\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    .custom-pr-section {\n        width: 100% !important;\n   